### ⚙️ Wiring for SG90
| Servo Wire | ESP8266 Pin | Description |
|-------------|-------------|--------------|
| Orange      | D3          | Signal (PWM) |
| Red         | 3.3V or 5V  | Power        |
| Brown       | GND         | Ground       |

⚠️ *If servo jitters or resets the ESP8266, use an **external 5V power supply** for the servo and connect **grounds together** (servo GND to ESP8266 GND).*

